+# Squashfs test images
+
+`symlinks.sqfs` contains regular files and relative, absolute, dangling,
+self-referential and directory symlinks. It can be recreated with
+`squashfs-tools`:
+
+```sh
+mkdir -p tree/src
+printf hello > tree/src/file.txt
+printf 'ordinary data' > tree/src/plain.rclonelink
+ln -s file.txt tree/src/link.txt
+ln -s missing tree/src/dangling
+ln -s . tree/src/dirlink
+ln -s loop tree/src/loop
+ln -s file.txt tree/src/suffix.rclonelink
+ln -s /does/not/exist tree/src/absolute
+mksquashfs tree symlinks.sqfs -noappend -all-root -no-xattrs \
+  -mkfs-time 0 -all-time 0 -no-progress
+```
