+++ b/docs/content/archive.md
@@ -100,6 +100,20 @@ kacak/
 ```
 
 
+## Symbolic links
+
+Symbolic links in ZIP and SquashFS archives are skipped by default, with
+an advisory notice. Use `-l`/`--links` to expose them as files whose names
+have a `.rclonelink` suffix and whose contents are the link target path.
+Links are not followed, including links to directories.
+
+Copying with `--links` recreates the symbolic links on destinations that
+support them, such as the local filesystem:
+
+```sh
+rclone copy --links :archive:remote:path/test.zip /tmp/out
+```
+
 ## Modification times
 
 Modification times are preserved with an accuracy depending on the archive type.
